The files in this directory come from Visual Studio Code at commit
ef5ca45a6e545e4767e0117905ee9d6120b86e11 (https://github.com/microsoft/vscode):

- seti.woff and vs-seti-icon-theme.json are extensions/theme-seti/icons/seti.woff and
  extensions/theme-seti/icons/vs-seti-icon-theme.json, unmodified. VS Code builds them from Seti UI
  (https://github.com/jesseweed/seti-ui) at commit 2d6c5e68b4ded73c92dac291845ee44e1182d511.
- vscode-language-associations.json lists, in VS Code's registration order, the extensions, file
  names and file-name patterns of the languages VS Code registers built in: plain text from
  src/vs/editor/common/languages/modesRegistry.ts, then the language contributions of the
  extensions/*/package.json manifests.

resolveFileIcon.ts follows the order in which VS Code applies an icon theme's file names,
extensions and language identifiers, and the glob syntax of VS Code's language associations.


